"""Splitting a bill. Four friends split a Rs 4,750 dinner. 
Print each person's share using /. Then look up the // and
 % operators and use them to print how many whole rupees 
 each person pays and how many rupees are left over"""


bill = 4750
friends = 4

share = bill / friends
whole_rupees = bill // friends
leftover = bill % friends

print(share)
print(whole_rupees)
print(leftover)

